      {
        "paragraph_index": 5,
        "style": "Body Text",
        "category": "body",
        "text": "RegRipper is an open-source tool to perform Windows Registry analysis. Windows Registry is a database that contains the default settings, user settings and system defined settings in a Windows system. Registry monitors, observes and records activities performed by the user in the computer.",
